  "exact_successor_authorization_text": "I approve one bounded local-only Lumi registry-v0.17 non-production learning-candidate seal successor. Bind candidate-mix v0.12 report SHA-256 2389e61c66fa0000690fe119745e963b9cc2cab1eb26e61224bef87ef9522dcb and verification SHA-256 d12d28e192cf31e33d3c034293868a720fd74d9934ae506c0e1d5c2d1d3c18d2, immutable source registry v0.17 SHA-256 85a688a62be0902b177469c99eb31525fb633efab5e420416b705d03e8d80e1a, frozen data contract v0.1 SHA-256 9a283d9333d29deb7b516fa45eb4eec50232be9925f4ee4aa3a8f624213b2f06, final-base binding SHA-256 1faaf5398f554b4708948b3298405a0451a31fe60027da359b54685a876b9172, chat template SHA-256 bc7853a9277feddae2fd3db786c6a12f4fa3602a135a0408c38d4390f33bec12, and tokenizer.json SHA-256 1022c9538d9ec795b07c2e2bda3c5c6f21c321de933cfe5ad197628a94caa2ee. Read exactly the 264,981 already verified candidate records across the 11 bound registry-v0.17 candidate sources, totaling 359,324,855 input bytes, and materialize deterministic source-id-lexical then existing-file-order train and validation JSONL containing exactly 251,176 train records / 7,341,582 train supervised tokens and 13,805 validation records / 427,005 validation supervised tokens. Exclude the retired 1,463-row gpt-oss closure supplement SHA-256 e8c0a360c898e6c8f78701c27f534b49f8bbe43c557bec9d15f0ec2c4eb74b1e. Replay the frozen schema, rights, provenance, secret, PII, benchmark-decontamination, tokenizer, chat-template, assistant-and-tool-only masking, 4K-fit, exact-duplicate, train-validation overlap, and bound MinHash 0.9 evidence gates; fail closed on any input, hash, row, token, split, source, or gate mismatch. Label the resulting seal explicitly non-production and smoke-only, preserve the frozen 10M production floor and every registry production blocker, and do not represent it as a production dataset seal. Maximum 120 local runtime-minutes / 2 sequential full passes / 529,962 total row reads / 1,073,741,824 private write bytes / 0 network bytes / 0 GPU use. It may create only a versioned implementation, runner, verifier, test, private train and validation JSONL, raw-text-free seal manifest, and independent verification. No source or registry mutation, active data-contract change, closure-row inclusion, external API, download, S3 action, production dataset seal, SFT training, production promotion, remote access, instance action, or unrelated access.",
